OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, bright and sunny start
OL,6,Fto the day with blue skies. Cloud will
OL,7,Fincrease from late morning with a few
OL,8,Fshowery outbreaks of rain. Feeling
OL,9,Fvery warm in the sunshine, though
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy this evening with an
OL,13,Fincreasing chance of some showers.
OL,14,FShowery rain will become more
OL,15,Fwidespread in the early hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,18,Fday with strengthening winds. Rain
OL,19,Fwill ease a little into the afternoon,
OL,20,Fbecoming more showery with a chance of
OL,21,Fbrighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
